{
  "format": "sfxgen/1",
  "name": "Jump take-off",
  "description": "A light runner in trainers and a tracksuit jumping straight up from the sprung wooden floor of a small gym (the same person and floor as \"Soft landing\"). First the legs drive and the boards take the load through the heels, a dull, dense knock with no note in it. As the weight rolls to the toes there is a second, lighter knock, and the rubber soles scrub and twist on the lacquer, a dry scuff with a short rising sneaker chirp in it as they let go. At the same time the body goes up through its own clothes, a grainy rustle of nylon that thins out as the feet leave, over a faint rush of air. No cartoon boing and no whoosh: the effort is in the push and the shoes.",
  "tags": [
    "movement",
    "jump",
    "take-off",
    "leap",
    "footstep",
    "sneaker",
    "player",
    "platformer",
    "foley"
  ],
  "duration": "auto",
  "seed": 7,
  "tracks": [
    {
